<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">We are very much happy to introduce College of Pharmacy, Indore. A Pioneer Pharmacy Institute which is established in 2004 with a proclaimed objective to develop the students as competent pharmacist and highly qualified dedicated professionals. We want to redefine the concept of Pharmacy Education in today’s global era with an aim to serve humanity in a better way. College of Pharmacy assures to mould an ideal Pharmacy professional who can cater the needs of society and the challenging Pharmacy profession. Our college is provided with the lush green campus, young dynamic and meritorious faculty, well-furnished and equipped laboratories with modern instruments, excellent library, computer lab, state of art medicinal garden. </span></p>
